{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A powerful and easy-to-use tool to personalize your visual experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>\ud83d\ude80</strong>\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f Change atmosphere during gaming or work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Adjust color and brightness as you wish to protect your eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Use your JPG/PNG images as screen filters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(3 eye-protective filters and 3 custom image filters are our gift to you.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u2728 Key Features:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Color Filters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real-time RGB, saturation, brightness adjustment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 0-100% transparency control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save your filters to a list</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easily apply / rename / delete your saved filters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f Image Overlays:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Add JPG/PNG images via drag-and-drop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Image transparency adjustment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save your images to a list</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easily apply / change opacity / delete your saved images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Automatic Save Management:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All settings are automatically saved</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Last used filters and overlays are remembered and automatically set at startup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Your settings are safe even in unexpected shutdowns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a1 Ease of Use:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Instant control with SHIFT + ESC, F1, F2, F3, F4 shortcuts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Automatic system language detection (30+ languages supported)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Low resource consumption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Usage Scenarios:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfae For Gamers: Night mode, atmospheric color and image filters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f Accessibility: Color optimization for visually impaired</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\udcbb Daily Use: Reduce eye strain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform Your Screen with FilterMob! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect tool for eye protection, changing your work atmosphere, or enhancing visual accessibility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily apply Color and Image (JPG/PNG) filters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize with real-time RGB, saturation, brightness, and transparency adjustments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895750?t=1756778670","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895750/c50790ce3eb7df4fb4c57b0579ee28344e609f5c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756778670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895750/3646c90ecb715a7a0c066191bed227932027b1d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756778670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895750/3646c90ecb715a7a0c066191bed227932027b1d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756778670","categories":[{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"descript